<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">
      {% include "partials/node-mark.njk" %}
      About
    </div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Studying how participation around products is changing.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Communitygeeks is a participation research and advisory practice founded by Carmelito Bauer. We study how companies build relationships with the people around their products, users, developers, creators, partners, and advocates.</p>
