<section class="band principle-field-host">
  {{ geoPlate(shapes=[
    { type: "circle", cx: 250, cy: 30, r: 110, color: "petrol", opacity: 0.08 },
    { type: "rect", x: 60, y: 280, w: 170, h: 140, color: "brass", opacity: 0.08 }
  ], viewBox="0 0 260 420", extraClass="principle-field") }}
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head">
      <div class="section-marker">
        {% include "partials/node-mark.njk" %}
        <span class="label">How We Think</span>
      </div>
      <h2>What is genuinely changing, and what isn't.</h2>
      <p class="think-intro">The same few ideas shape every engagement, translated here rather than stated as internal methodology.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-list">
      <div class="principle-item">
        <h3 class="principle-title">Start with the ecosystem, not the platform</h3>
        <p class="principle-desc">We begin with the people around a product and the relationships between them, not with the assumption that the answer is another Discord, forum, or community platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-item">
        <h3 class="principle-title">Research before prescription</h3>
        <p class="principle-desc">Community, DevRel, partnerships, and advocacy increasingly overlap. We look at how participation actually works before recommending where teams, programs, or platforms should sit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-item">
        <h3 class="principle-title">Build for what is changing</h3>
        <p class="principle-desc">AI is changing discovery, support, content creation, and product adoption. We combine hands-on operating experience with ongoing practitioner research to understand what is genuinely changing, and what isn't.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

